#
# Whether a transfer is allowed, in Sutra: an amount of 1 to 2^53 - 1
# minor units, after (the paying balance after it) and room (the per-day
# cap left after it) not below zero, gap (out minus in) zero. Every field
# is s9(18): a value past 18 digits is refused. transfer.eve says the same
# in Eve; the app posts only when both say TRUE.
record coffer-transfer
  amount: s9(18)
  after: s9(18)
  room: s9(18)
  gap: s9(18)
procedure
  answer amount >= 1 and amount <= 9007199254740991 and after >= 0 and room >= 0 and gap = 0
